+/* KZ3 patch 1042 (SPU pass 29): milliseconds from t0 to now, 0 when t0 is later than now. The watcher read now
+ * once per 50 ms pass, before the instance loop, while kernel threads keep stamping s_run_t0 with a fresh
+ * GetTickCount64(); a run that started after that read (the pc sampling of an earlier instance in the same pass sleeps
